      {
        "id": 252915,
        "name": "liarliar",
        "username": "liarliar",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/liarliar/{size}/1951_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-06-21T22:37:33.129Z",
        "cooked": "<p>And if you are tossing up whether or not to give those print-and-play materials a try, let me ABSOLUTELY encourage you to do so - the game is super fun! Having both players/teams pick their actions simultaneously makes play flow pretty smoothly, and resolution is quite straightforward too. Characters feel pretty tough, all having their own ways to be over-the-top powerful.<br>\n(Well, except Sky-Scraper, but I get the impression she didn’t get a lot of playtesting before cancellation)</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2023-06-21T22:37:33.129Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
